===Etymology 2===
{{ja-kanjitab|alt=或る,或:dated}}

The {{ja-r|連%体%形|れん%たい%けい|adnominal form}} of the classical verb {{ja-r|有り|あり|to exist}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{ja-pron|acc=a|acc_ref=DJR}}

====Adnominal====
